  "notes": "RP2350 Stamp castellated module, 40 edge pads. GPIO pins printed only as numbers (kept as label). Functions read outward: SPI, UART, I2C, PWM slice, then A0-A3/HSTX/XIP CS tags. The 5V note is printed with a stray trailing 'ax' fragment ('3.6V-6.5V main power input  ax'); kept as printed. Board corner marks 0/10/20 and a ground symbol coincide with GPIO numbering and were not used as position numbers. Buttons skipped; color legend omitted."
